{"seq":3,"slug":"olap-basics","title":"OLAP 基础：OLAP vs OLTP、多维分析、ClickHouse/Doris/StarRocks","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/data-warehouse-basics/olap-basics","wordCount":1220,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"olap-基础-olap-vs-oltp-多维分析-clickhouse-doris-starrocks\">OLAP 基础：OLAP vs OLTP、多维分析、ClickHouse/Doris/StarRocks</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>OLTP vs OLAP</strong>：前者面向事务处理（点查询、高并发、毫秒级），后者面向分析处理（聚合查询、大数据量扫描、秒级到分钟级）</li>\n<li><strong>列式存储</strong>：OLAP 引擎的基础，通过只读需要的列、高压缩比和向量化执行实现高性能</li>\n<li><strong>OLAP 操作</strong>：切片（固定一个维度）、切块（固定多个维度）、上卷（细到粗）、下钻（粗到细）、旋转（交换行列）</li>\n<li><strong>ClickHouse</strong>：MPP 架构，单表查询性能极致，但实时写入能力弱</li>\n<li><strong>Doris / StarRocks</strong>：MySQL 协议兼容，兼顾多表 JOIN 与实时写入，适合实时数仓</li>\n<li><strong>查询优化策略</strong>：分区裁剪、预聚合、索引优化、排序键设计与 Colocate Join</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"olap-与-oltp-的本质区别\">OLAP 与 OLTP 的本质区别</h2><p>OLAP（Online Analytical Processing）和 OLTP（Online Transaction Processing）是两种根本不同的数据处理范式，它们的设计目标、数据模型和技术实现有着本质的差异。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph OLTP&#10;        A1[用户请求] --&gt; A2[单行读写]&#10;        A2 --&gt; A3[事务保证]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph OLAP&#10;        B1[分析查询] --&gt; B2[全表扫描]&#10;        B2 --&gt; B3[聚合计算]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph OLTP\n        A1[用户请求] --&gt; A2[单行读写]\n        A2 --&gt; A3[事务保证]\n    end\n    subgraph OLAP\n        B1[分析查询] --&gt; B2[全表扫描]\n        B2 --&gt; B3[聚合计算]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>OLTP</th>\n<th>OLAP</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>目标</td>\n<td>支撑业务运转</td>\n<td>支撑决策分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询类型</td>\n<td>点查询（WHERE id = ?）</td>\n<td>聚合查询（GROUP BY + SUM）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据量</td>\n<td>单次操作几行</td>\n<td>单次扫描数百万到数十亿行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发</td>\n<td>高（数千 QPS）</td>\n<td>低（数十到数百 QPS）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n<td>秒级到分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据模型</td>\n<td>行存储、高度范式化</td>\n<td>列存储、宽表/星型模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表产品</td>\n<td>MySQL/PostgreSQL/Oracle</td>\n<td>ClickHouse/Doris/StarRocks</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"列式存储\">列式存储</h2><p>列式存储是 OLAP 数据库的核心技术，它从根本上改变了数据在磁盘上的组织方式。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 行存储&#10;        R1[Row1: id=1 name=张三 age=25 city=北京]&#10;        R2[Row2: id=2 name=李四 age=30 city=上海]&#10;        R3[Row3: id=3 name=王五 age=28 city=广州]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 列存储&#10;        C1[id列: 1 2 3]&#10;        C2[name列: 张三 李四 王五]&#10;        C3[age列: 25 30 28]&#10;        C4[city列: 北京 上海 广州]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 行存储\n        R1[Row1: id=1 name=张三 age=25 city=北京]\n        R2[Row2: id=2 name=李四 age=30 city=上海]\n        R3[Row3: id=3 name=王五 age=28 city=广州]\n    end\n    subgraph 列存储\n        C1[id列: 1 2 3]\n        C2[name列: 张三 李四 王五]\n        C3[age列: 25 30 28]\n        C4[city列: 北京 上海 广州]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>行存储</th>\n<th>列存储</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存储方式</td>\n<td>一行数据连续存储</td>\n<td>一列数据连续存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读取效率</td>\n<td>读一行很快</td>\n<td>读几列很快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压缩率</td>\n<td>低（混合数据类型）</td>\n<td>高（同类型数据压缩好）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合查询</td>\n<td>SELECT * WHERE id = ?</td>\n<td>SELECT SUM(amount) GROUP BY</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写入效率</td>\n<td>行级写入高效</td>\n<td>需要拆分到多列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>OLTP</td>\n<td>OLAP</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"列存储的性能优势\">列存储的性能优势</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>只读需要的列</td>\n<td>100 列的表只查 3 列时，IO 减少 97%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高压缩比</td>\n<td>同类型数据压缩比可达 10:1 以上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>向量化执行</td>\n<td>同列数据批量处理，利用 CPU SIMD 指令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟物化</td>\n<td>尽可能晚地构造完整行，减少中间数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"多维分析-olap-操作\">多维分析（OLAP 操作）</h2><h3 id=\"olap-基本操作\">OLAP 基本操作</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[OLAP 操作] --&gt; B[切片 Slice]&#10;    A --&gt; C[切块 Dice]&#10;    A --&gt; D[上卷 Roll-up]&#10;    A --&gt; E[下钻 Drill-down]&#10;    A --&gt; F[旋转 Pivot]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[固定一个维度的值]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[固定多个维度的值]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[从细粒度到粗粒度]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[从粗粒度到细粒度]&#10;    F --&gt; F1[交换行列维度]\">graph TD\n    A[OLAP 操作] --&gt; B[切片 Slice]\n    A --&gt; C[切块 Dice]\n    A --&gt; D[上卷 Roll-up]\n    A --&gt; E[下钻 Drill-down]\n    A --&gt; F[旋转 Pivot]\n    B --&gt; B1[固定一个维度的值]\n    C --&gt; C1[固定多个维度的值]\n    D --&gt; D1[从细粒度到粗粒度]\n    E --&gt; E1[从粗粒度到细粒度]\n    F --&gt; F1[交换行列维度]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 上卷：从日粒度汇总到月粒度&#10;SELECT&#10;    DATE_TRUNC(&#39;month&#39;, order_date) AS month,&#10;    SUM(amount) AS total_revenue&#10;FROM orders&#10;GROUP BY DATE_TRUNC(&#39;month&#39;, order_date);&#10;&#10;-- 下钻：从月粒度展开到日粒度&#10;SELECT&#10;    DATE(order_date) AS date,&#10;    SUM(amount) AS daily_revenue&#10;FROM orders&#10;WHERE DATE_TRUNC(&#39;month&#39;, order_date) = &#39;2025-03-01&#39;&#10;GROUP BY DATE(order_date)&#10;ORDER BY date;&#10;&#10;-- 切片：固定时间维度&#10;SELECT&#10;    product_category,&#10;    region,&#10;    SUM(amount) AS revenue&#10;FROM orders&#10;WHERE DATE(order_date) = &#39;2025-03-15&#39;&#10;GROUP BY product_category, region;&#10;&#10;-- 切块：固定多个维度&#10;SELECT&#10;    DATE(order_date) AS date,&#10;    SUM(amount) AS revenue&#10;FROM orders&#10;WHERE product_category = &#39;数码&#39;&#10;  AND region = &#39;华东&#39;&#10;  AND order_date BETWEEN &#39;2025-03-01&#39; AND &#39;2025-03-31&#39;&#10;GROUP BY DATE(order_date);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 上卷：从日粒度汇总到月粒度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    DATE_TRUNC(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'month'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, order_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> month</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_revenue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DATE_TRUNC(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'month'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, order_date);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 下钻：从月粒度展开到日粒度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily_revenue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DATE_TRUNC(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'month'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, order_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2025-03-01'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order_date)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 切片：固定时间维度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    product_category,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    region,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> revenue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2025-03-15'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product_category, region;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 切块：固定多个维度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> revenue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product_category </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '数码'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> region </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '华东'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2025-03-01'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2025-03-31'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order_date);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"主流-olap-引擎\">主流 OLAP 引擎</h2><h3 id=\"clickhouse\">ClickHouse</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>架构</td>\n<td>MPP 架构，Share Nothing</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储</td>\n<td>列存储 + MergeTree 引擎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询性能</td>\n<td>极致的单表查询性能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写入方式</td>\n<td>批量写入（不适合高频小批量）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布式</td>\n<td>原生分布式，支持分片和副本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SQL 兼容</td>\n<td>大部分标准 SQL，有独特扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态</td>\n<td>活跃的开源社区，Yandex 主导开发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"apache-doris\">Apache Doris</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>架构</td>\n<td>MPP 架构，FE（前端）+ BE（后端）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储</td>\n<td>列存储，支持多种数据模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询性能</td>\n<td>兼顾 OLAP 查询和点查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写入方式</td>\n<td>支持实时写入和批量导入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布式</td>\n<td>原生分布式，自动负载均衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SQL 兼容</td>\n<td>MySQL 协议兼容，迁移成本低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态</td>\n<td>Apache 顶级项目，中国社区活跃</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"starrocks\">StarRocks</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>架构</td>\n<td>基于 Doris 改进，FE + BE 架构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储</td>\n<td>列存储 + 智能物化视图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询性能</td>\n<td>向量化引擎 + CBO 优化器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写入方式</td>\n<td>支持实时和批量，Primary Key 模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>联邦查询</td>\n<td>可直接查询 Hive/Iceberg/Hudi 数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SQL 兼容</td>\n<td>MySQL 协议兼容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态</td>\n<td>快速发展的开源社区</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"olap-引擎对比\">OLAP 引擎对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>ClickHouse</th>\n<th>Doris</th>\n<th>StarRocks</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单表查询</td>\n<td>极强</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>极强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多表 JOIN</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>极强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实时写入</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发能力</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运维复杂度</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MySQL 兼容</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物化视图</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>智能物化视图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>联邦查询</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>强力支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"选型建议\">选型建议</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[OLAP 引擎选型] --&gt; B{核心需求?}&#10;    B --&gt;|极致单表性能| C[ClickHouse]&#10;    B --&gt;|实时数仓| D{MySQL 兼容重要?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[Doris / StarRocks]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| C&#10;    B --&gt;|多表复杂分析| F[StarRocks]&#10;    B --&gt;|联邦查询数据湖| F\">graph TD\n    A[OLAP 引擎选型] --&gt; B{核心需求?}\n    B --&gt;|极致单表性能| C[ClickHouse]\n    B --&gt;|实时数仓| D{MySQL 兼容重要?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[Doris / StarRocks]\n    D --&gt;|否| C\n    B --&gt;|多表复杂分析| F[StarRocks]\n    B --&gt;|联邦查询数据湖| F</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"olap-查询优化\">OLAP 查询优化</h2><h3 id=\"常见优化策略\">常见优化策略</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分区裁剪</td>\n<td>按时间分区，查询时限定分区范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预聚合</td>\n<td>物化视图或预计算表减少实时计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索引优化</td>\n<td>Bitmap 索引适合低基数列，稀疏索引适合有序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据压缩</td>\n<td>选择合适的编码和压缩算法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序键</td>\n<td>按查询模式设置排序键优化扫描范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Colocate Join</td>\n<td>将关联表的数据分布到同一节点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- ClickHouse 建表示例&#10;CREATE TABLE events&#10;(&#10;    event_date Date,&#10;    event_time DateTime,&#10;    user_id UInt64,&#10;    event_name LowCardinality(String),&#10;    properties String&#10;)&#10;ENGINE = MergeTree()&#10;PARTITION BY toYYYYMM(event_date)&#10;ORDER BY (event_name, user_id, event_time)&#10;SETTINGS index_granularity = 8192;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ClickHouse 建表示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_time </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DateTime</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    user_id UInt64,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_name LowCardinality(String),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    properties String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ENGINE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MergeTree()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> toYYYYMM(event_date)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (event_name, user_id, event_time)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SETTINGS index_granularity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8192</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>OLTP 面向事务处理（点查询、高并发），OLAP 面向分析处理（聚合查询、大数据量扫描）</li>\n<li>列式存储是 OLAP 引擎的基础，通过只读需要的列、高压缩比和向量化执行实现高性能</li>\n<li>OLAP 的核心操作包括切片、切块、上卷、下钻和旋转</li>\n<li>ClickHouse 单表性能极致，Doris/StarRocks 兼顾多表 JOIN 和实时写入</li>\n<li>分区裁剪、预聚合和排序键设计是 OLAP 查询优化的核心策略</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"OLAP 基础：OLAP vs OLTP、多维分析、ClickHouse/Doris/StarRocks","id":"olap-基础-olap-vs-oltp-多维分析-clickhouse-doris-starrocks"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"OLAP 与 OLTP 的本质区别","id":"olap-与-oltp-的本质区别"},{"level":2,"text":"列式存储","id":"列式存储"},{"level":3,"text":"列存储的性能优势","id":"列存储的性能优势"},{"level":2,"text":"多维分析（OLAP 操作）","id":"多维分析-olap-操作"},{"level":3,"text":"OLAP 基本操作","id":"olap-基本操作"},{"level":2,"text":"主流 OLAP 引擎","id":"主流-olap-引擎"},{"level":3,"text":"ClickHouse","id":"clickhouse"},{"level":3,"text":"Apache Doris","id":"apache-doris"},{"level":3,"text":"StarRocks","id":"starrocks"},{"level":3,"text":"OLAP 引擎对比","id":"olap-引擎对比"},{"level":3,"text":"选型建议","id":"选型建议"},{"level":2,"text":"OLAP 查询优化","id":"olap-查询优化"},{"level":3,"text":"常见优化策略","id":"常见优化策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"ETL 流水线：数据抽取/转换/加载、调度系统、增量处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/data-warehouse-basics/etl-pipeline"},"next":{"title":"数据湖：数据湖 vs 数据仓库、Lakehouse 架构、Iceberg/Hudi","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/data-analytics-engineering/data-warehouse-basics/data-lake"}}